<title>GERMANY: Frankfurt bourse to resume price setting.</title>
<headline>Frankfurt bourse to resume price setting.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Frankfurt bourse said that the exchange would again be able to set prices for trading at 1115 GMT after an earlier technical problem interrupted trade.</p>
<p>But the exchange said that its IBIS electronic trading systems -- for shares and bonds -- were still not working due to a technical fault.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
